IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0047.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 MAX-TERM           PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    05 ELIGIBLE-FLAG      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "MAX-TERM=" MAX-TERM
    DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE-FLAG=" ELIGIBLE-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF CUST-AGE >= 18
        IF CUST-AGE > 65
            MOVE 10 TO MAX-TERM
            MOVE 'Y' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
        ELSE IF CUST-AGE > 55
            MOVE 20 TO MAX-TERM
            MOVE 'Y' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
        ELSE
            MOVE 30 TO MAX-TERM
            MOVE 'Y' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
        END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
    END-IF.
